# {{ name }}

> TODO: Describe what this library provides.

Shared .NET library, generated from the `dotnet-library` template.

## Using it from an app

1. Reference the project from the consuming app's `.csproj`:
   ```xml
   <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\..\packages\{{ name }}\src\{{ name | pascal_case }}\{{ name | pascal_case }}.csproj" />
   ```
2. Declare the dependency in the app's `moon.yml` so CI and deploys pick up changes:
   ```yaml
   dependsOn:
     - '{{ name }}'
   ```
3. If the app has a Dockerfile, copy this package into the build stage as well.

## Commands

| Command | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `make run APP={{ name }} TASK=test` | Run tests |
| `make run APP={{ name }} TASK=lint` | Verify formatting |
